+---
+# Plugin
+* Added command `swag:low-stock:digest` listing active products at or below the configured threshold, with `--json` and `--csv` output
+* Added `LowStockDigestPrintedEvent`, logged by `LowStockDigestLogSubscriber`
+* Added `LowStockDigestFormatter` for the table and CSV output
+* Added config `SwagLowStockDigest.config.threshold`, default 5
